sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant G as Gmail
  participant SCH as Worker: trigger job
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant RUN as Worker: run engine
  actor Ali as Ali
  SCH->>G: any new email? (every 60 s, Gmail push later)
  G-->>SCH: yes, one new email
  SCH->>DB: skip duplicates (message id), save the cursor,<br/>queue a run for each bot that subscribed
  DB->>RUN: job "start run" (bot = Inbox, input = the email)
  Note right of RUN: reads the email (auto).<br/>The run is now tainted.
  Note right of RUN: label, draft, send a reply:<br/>policy says ASK (tainted run),<br/>unless a saved rule allows it
  RUN->>DB: approval request + checkpoint
  RUN-->>Ali: notification + approval card
  Note over SCH,RUN: Routines work the same way,<br/>started by the clock instead of an email
